To build an RPM from source:

    rpmbuild -ba packaging/rpm/spine.spec \
        --define "_sourcedir $(pwd)" \
        --define "_builddir $(pwd)/_build"

Or install the spec to your rpmbuild tree:

    cp packaging/rpm/spine.spec ~/rpmbuild/SPECS/
    spectool -g -R packaging/rpm/spine.spec
    rpmbuild -ba ~/rpmbuild/SPECS/spine.spec

The RPM spec uses the native CMake + Ninja build path.
